# Core Database Migrations

Alembic revisions for the core database.

These migrations belong to `democrai.core` and only change the internal runtime
database schema: users, roles, preferences, registries, sessions, tasks and
technical core state.

Use the runner:

```bash
python main.py create-migration db -m "description" --autogenerate
python main.py migrate db
python main.py rollback db --steps 1
python main.py migration-status db
```

Do not add module migrations here. Module migrations live in:

```text
modules/<module>/migrations/
```

Generate module migrations with:

```bash
python main.py create-migration data --module <module> -m "description" --autogenerate
```
